<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-cooksonia-pertoni-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Cooksonia pertoni Turing wavelength at 1.3 µm (425 Ma) — Code-to-model traceability: 86/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The module docstring states the PDE, the exact Jacobian, the predecessor and successor, and the claim boundary. Lean theorems are the cross-multiplied trace, determinant, and threshold inequalities, not renamed arithmetic. Deducted because the shell-power match that builds the GIF is a rendering calibration, not an equation in Turing 1952." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cooksonia-pertoni-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cooksonia-pertoni-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-cooksonia-pertoni-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Cooksonia pertoni Turing wavelength at 1.3 µm (425 Ma) — Model fidelity to source: 86/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The Jacobian at a=3/25, b=21/25 is the exact Schnakenberg linearisation (trace -0.172, det 0.922). Dispersion uses J - k^2 D, and six real-eigenvalue Fourier modes grown with the same 3-point Laplacian match analytic sigma with Pearson r = 1.000 and RMSE 1.4e-4. Equal diffusion is stable. Deducted because Edwards published no reaction-diffusion system, and the 1.339 µm scale is imposed by the length unit rather than measured on a tracheid." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "models/2026-delphi10000-cooksonia-pertoni-turing-wavelength-s0.py L1–L55: 1.339 µm is an assigned scale, stated as such <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8308af02867b4125a973e632c1b5c530ef0ddf71/models/2026-delphi10000-cooksonia-pertoni-turing-wavelength-s0.py#L1-L55>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cooksonia-pertoni-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cooksonia-pertoni-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cooksonia-pertoni-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-cooksonia-pertoni-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Cooksonia pertoni Turing wavelength at 1.3 µm (425 Ma) — Morphometric validation: 87/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Discrete-Laplacian dispersion Pearson r = 1.000 (RMSE 1.4e-4) on modes 3-8. Specimen radial-spectrum Pearson r = 0.9865, RMSE 0.205, gray KS 0.028 against the Amgueddfa photograph. Model branch angle 64.4 degrees versus template 70.0 degrees on that photo and 67.5 degrees on the NMNH slab (values differ from their references). Stripe spacing of the saturated field is 1.339 µm. Successor wavelength 1.695 µm is longer than the focal wavelength. Deducted because the branch angle is a coarse template (2.5 degree steps), not a published morphometric, and the spacing CV is exactly 0 on a pure mode." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cooksonia-pertoni-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-control-amplitude-ratio>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cooksonia-pertoni-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-dispersion-pearson-r>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cooksonia-pertoni-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-dispersion-rmse>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cooksonia-pertoni-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-predecessor-equal-diffusion-sigma-max>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cooksonia-pertoni-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-selected-wavelength>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cooksonia-pertoni-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-axis-branch-angle>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cooksonia-pertoni-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-image-gray-ks-statistic>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cooksonia-pertoni-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-radial-spectrum-pearson-r>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cooksonia-pertoni-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-radial-spectrum-rmse>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cooksonia-pertoni-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-stripe-spacing-cv>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cooksonia-pertoni-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-successor-rhynia-wavelength>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cooksonia-pertoni-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-turing-critical-wavenumber-k-c>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cooksonia-pertoni-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cooksonia-pertoni-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.7e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-cooksonia-pertoni-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Cooksonia pertoni Turing wavelength at 1.3 µm (425 Ma) — MorphoEval overall 85.8/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Schnakenberg kinetics at a=0.12, b=0.84, D_v/D_u=10, just above the Turing threshold. k_c=2.356, lambda_c=1.339 µm at 425 Ma. Equal diffusion (predecessor) has sigma_max=-0.086. A longer diffusion length for Rhynia gwynne-vaughanii at 407 Ma moves lambda_c to 1.695 µm. Dispersion Pearson r against the discrete Laplacian is 1.000 on six real-eigenvalue modes. The growth GIF is a Y-shaped axis on a matrix whose radial spectrum matches the Amgueddfa Cymru compression (CV similarity 95.4). The 1.3 µm field is the comparison-figure panel, not a feature resolved by the photograph. Overall 85.8/100 (faithfulness 85.1, reproducibility 87.3); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8308af02867b4125a973e632c1b5c530ef0ddf71; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 86, Morphological realism / specimen match 82, Parameter expressivity 88, Morphometric validation 87, Source and data traceability 90, Code-to-model traceability 86, Reproducibility package 86. Output judged: docs/media/cooksonia_pertoni_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-cooksonia-pertoni-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 8308af02867b4125a973e632c1b5c530ef0ddf71, image/png, 624221 B, 1344×1008 px, artifact_sha256 93e88f9e5d0b1916ed5ac99e152f066fa81e55e1cdb7c84aa9cb4d4df4141a54 (sha256 93e88f9e5d0b1916ed5ac99e152f066fa81e55e1cdb7c84aa9cb4d4df4141a54), spec_fingerprint ce7d40be6d01f3179ec22b3cb8fbb558f6f40b6cad5c716ca069f671182a9ec4. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: ce7d40be6d01f3179ec22b3cb8fbb558f6f40b6cad5c716ca069f671182a9ec4; artifact_sha256: 93e88f9e5d0b1916ed5ac99e152f066fa81e55e1cdb7c84aa9cb4d4df4141a54; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/cooksonia_pertoni_turing_wavelength_s0/cooksonia_pertoni_amgueddfa_specimen.jpg=aa48bf1c9b50b41d..., datasets/cooksonia_pertoni_turing_wavelength_s0/cooksonia_pertoni_nmnh_specimen.jpg=6c6d03579c80de68..., datasets/cooksonia_pertoni_turing_wavelength_s0/cooksonia_pertoni_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=b36860960a26851c...}. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Edwards, Davies & Axe 1992: C. pertoni has a vascular strand with annular to spiral tracheids. | Turing 1952 dispersion relation and Schnakenberg 1979 kinetics. | Edwards 2003: early tracheophyte walls are annular, spiral or scalariform-like.; reconstructed_in_script: Parameters chosen so the fastest mode is 1.339 µm. | Successor D_u raised from 0.055 to 0.088 at fixed ratio. | Isotomous axis drawn on a spectrum-matched matrix.; transfer_boundary: 1.3 µm is the assigned detail scale, not an Edwards measurement. | The museum slab is a centimetre-scale compression.; does_not_claim: That Cooksonia had animal-style ocelli. | That the photograph resolves 1.3 µm wall bands. | That the 73 µm sibling parameters apply at this scale.." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: {'id': 'R1', 'item': 'The GIF axis does not show helical Turing bands; shell-power matching removes them. Restore a visible axial modulation and re-measure CV similarity.'}",
        "remediation needed: {'id': 'R2', 'item': 'Branch-angle template uses 2.5 degree steps. Refine the sweep so the Amgueddfa and NMNH angles are not grid-snapped.'}",
        "remediation needed: {'id': 'R3', 'item': 'No independent second assessor. This pass is builder-scored.'}",
        "remediation needed: {'id': 'R4', 'item': 'No ~/.nanopub/profile.yml. Do not claim a signature.'}" ;
    pk:hasScore 8.58e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-cooksonia-pertoni-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
